{"id":"siguiente","lemma":"siguiente","pos":"adj","rank":480,"glosses":["following","next"],"ipa":"/siˈɡjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"siguientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-siguiente.wav","examples":[{"text":"La situación cambió el año siguiente.","en":"The situation changed the following year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692447","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"year"},null]},{"text":"Murió al día siguiente.","en":"He died the next day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735635","words":[{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"per day"]]},{"text":"¿Te gustaría contar la siguiente historia?","en":"Would you like to tell the next story?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689329","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to count"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"history"}]},{"text":"¿Qué te gustaría lograr en los siguientes tres años?","en":"What's something you'd like to achieve in the next three years?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to get, to obtain"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"year","l":"año"}]},{"text":"¿Quién es el siguiente?","en":"Who is next?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438449","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}